#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:3
#: b4eb60f161cd487eb1b9c27d6bc0f7d5
msgid "Correlated Random Spin"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:5
#: c720d37d6b2646b19f61306e70672774
msgid "`Group`: `Magnetism` | `Class`: `CorrelatedRandomSpinCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:7
#: 9cebbd421a474e0dbc19ef73c4206b30
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:9
#: 423a2b830c0441f3ab8b70631a249da4
msgid ""
"`Correlated Random Spin` "
"从已有磁矩或元素磁矩表出发，生成带空间相关长度的非共线随机磁矩。它保持每个原子的磁矩模长，只改变方向；相关性由距离核函数和 "
"`correlation_length` 控制。"
msgstr ""
"`Correlated Random Spin` starts from existing moments or an element-moment "
"map and generates a noncollinear random field with a finite spatial "
"correlation length. It preserves each moment magnitude and changes only "
"directions; a distance kernel and `correlation_length` control the "
"correlation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:11
#: 5b4ac6eac3f24d8cb9568d792f6613e1
msgid ""
"这张卡不叫 `Spin Glass`，因为它没有引入交换哈密顿量、frustration "
"约束或动力学冷却过程。它只表达一个清楚的训练集状态：空间相关的随机非共线自旋场。"
msgstr ""
"This card is deliberately not called `Spin Glass`: it includes no exchange "
"Hamiltonian, frustration constraint, or dynamical cooling. Its precise "
"training-set meaning is a spatially correlated random noncollinear spin "
"field."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:13
#: 18f7896a78a741f2baf8440871d26109
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:15
#: b2d17ee7002e4e7b8b51351dc52f4b9c
msgid "场景：训练集有 PM 随机态，但缺少有限相关长度的非共线态"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: PM-like random states exist, but finite-range noncollinear "
"correlations are missing"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:17
#: 91314f5bbdb440b594dd75fe44e4ce12
msgid ""
"模型在完全随机 PM 和有序 FM/AFM 上都能跑，但在短程相关的高温磁态上磁力误差明显偏大。用 `Correlated Random Spin` "
"可以生成相关长度为 3 Angstrom 的非共线扰动，让相邻原子磁矩方向更相近，远距离方向逐渐失相关。"
msgstr ""
"A model handles fully random PM-like states and ordered FM/AFM states but "
"has large magnetic-force error in short-range-correlated high-temperature "
"states. Generate noncollinear fields with a 3 Å correlation length so nearby"
" moments tend to align while distant directions decorrelate."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:19
#: 111447a4537443f59e894ecd6820db9a
msgid ""
"参数设置：`mode=Cone around "
"reference`，`correlation_kernel=exponential`，`correlation_length=3.0`，`samples=5`，`cone_angle=30.0`，`magnitude_source=Existing"
" initial magmoms`，`max_atoms_for_full=200`。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters: `mode=Cone around reference`, `correlation_kernel=exponential`, "
"`correlation_length=3.0`, `samples=5`, `cone_angle=30.0`, "
"`magnitude_source=Existing initial magmoms`, and `max_atoms_for_full=200`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:21
#: 1e7254691c6b45b9ad36b49cc0267e19
msgid ""
"输出结构的 `initial_magmoms` 为 `(N, 3)`，`Config_type` 追加 "
"`CorrSpin(...)`。检查时看磁矩模长是否保持、cone 角度是否符合设定，以及不同 `correlation_length` "
"下相邻自旋相似度是否变化。"
msgstr ""
"Output `initial_magmoms` has shape `(N, 3)` and `Config_type` gains "
"`CorrSpin(...)`. Verify preserved magnitudes, the requested cone bound, and "
"a measurable change in neighbor-spin similarity as `correlation_length` "
"changes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:23
#: 73b9344330a64d02bdc620d98eeb255e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:25
#: 81382ff73c11483b8dc4341e24f1073f
msgid "相关随机场"
msgstr "Correlated random field"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:27
#: 04899abbf0c646d88a00f5c0742a50ab
msgid "Mode（mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:28
#: e5b2fafd62e64ad68267b2697ebb2e18
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Cone around reference'`。`Cone around reference` "
"保留有序态的方向，只叠加有限温非共线涨落；`PM-like random field` 不再围绕参考方向，适合补 PM 附近但带空间相关长度的样本。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'Cone around reference'`. `Cone around reference` retains an"
" ordered reference and adds finite-temperature noncollinear fluctuations. "
"`PM-like random field` is not centered on the reference direction and "
"targets correlated PM-like samples."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:30
#: 1a4232bf65de41dbb6cd41c4b79cee23
msgid "Correlation Kernel（correlation_kernel）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:31
#: 92a0964d5ffd44a9b3f92274b546ceb9
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'exponential'`。自旋空间相关函数。`exponential` "
"衰减更慢，保留更长尾的自旋关联；`squared_exponential` 更平滑但远距离衰减更快。有限相关长度磁无序优先选 exponential。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'exponential'`. Spatial correlation kernel. `exponential` "
"has a longer tail; `squared_exponential` is smoother and decays faster. "
"Start with exponential for generic finite-range magnetic disorder."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:33
#: aeeafde7d0204f6ca0bc607ca9a96776
msgid "Correlation Length（correlation_length）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:34
#: fb889ac2df6240b0ac3b6e4e286bbf04
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 3.0 Å。自旋随机场的空间相关长度。设得比最近邻距离还小 → 近似独立随机；放大到几倍晶格常数 → "
"形成平滑磁畴。做有限温磁无序时不要一上来就跳到无限长相关。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `3.0` Å. Spatial correlation length. Below the nearest-"
"neighbor distance the field approaches independent randomness; several "
"lattice constants create smooth domains. Scan finite values before assuming "
"long-range correlation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:36
#: aaa54d046aac452bacdb6274e1fb90e2
msgid "Max Atoms For Full（max_atoms_for_full）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:37
#: ee60fdab04a44a73a643bdd5c16971a0
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 200。full covariance 方法能处理的最大原子数，因为需要 O(N³) 的 Cholesky "
"分解。小体系保持默认即可；超过几百个磁性原子时先缩小结构，不要盲目调大这个值。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `200`. Maximum atoms for full-covariance sampling, which "
"requires an O(N³) Cholesky factorization. Keep the default for small "
"systems; reduce a system with hundreds of magnetic atoms instead of blindly "
"raising this limit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:39
#: 2e1709eb0549432d9339ee05e6863a7b
msgid "输出和角度"
msgstr "Outputs and angular range"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:41
#: cba2e690764a46a7a7831f313d1b0890
msgid "Samples（samples）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:42
#: 2ed32006509f44f58f93b2ba584c75d9
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个相关长度下生成几个随机场样本。1~3 个覆盖趋势，5 个以上才开始给同一相关长度做统计。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. Random fields per correlation length. One to three trace"
" a trend; five or more begin to sample variability at one length."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:44
#: fff0341b86fa45bbb688b9e436c6d9fa
msgid "Cone Angle（cone_angle）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:45
#: 28881faad16a44ccb1c8e057e7e5201d
msgid "`float`，默认 30.0°。cone 模式下偏离参考方向的最大角度。10~30° 是有序态附近的扰动，60° 以上更接近强非共线无序。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `30.0` degrees. Maximum deviation from the reference in "
"cone mode. About 10-30 degrees represents fluctuations near order; above 60 "
"degrees approaches strong noncollinear disorder."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:47
#: 5d1514d021e9461ab2e86ca253e5384d
msgid "生效条件：`mode` 为 cone 模式时。"
msgstr "Active when `mode` is a cone mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:49
#: 2664554440584a268ff3e51d44b99cc6
msgid "磁矩幅值"
msgstr "Moment magnitudes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:51
#: fbf7bbefeda3479ebee0a1a978a7e89c
msgid "Magnitude Source（magnitude_source）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:52
#: 91a171decb6c4df4bff481d13404cab0
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Existing initial magmoms'`。磁矩幅值的来源。有 `initial_magmoms` "
"时优先复用，最安全；没有磁矩输入时用 `magmom_map` 和 `default_moment` 构造。不要用默认幅值替代已知元素的实测磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'Existing initial magmoms'`. Source of moment magnitudes. "
"Reuse `initial_magmoms` when present; otherwise construct magnitudes from "
"`magmom_map` and `default_moment`. Do not replace known element moments with"
" a generic default."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:54
#: 07847bad30624f608cc1ca0138cf6cd0
msgid "Magmom Map（magmom_map）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:55
#: 708c07445d74403c85842aa28b01f587
msgid "`str`，默认空。按元素显式指定磁矩幅值，格式如 `Fe:2.2, Ni:0.6`。已知元素局域磁矩就填进去，未知元素别用默认值伪造先验。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. Explicit element magnitudes such as `Fe:2.2, "
"Ni:0.6`. Enter known local moments and avoid inventing priors for unknown "
"species."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:57
#: 92cc1ea0fb1d4e3f92e0da63c7b2e498
msgid "Default Moment（default_moment）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:58
#: d16bd699602949d3904db53531dcbc60
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.0。作为 `magmom_map` 没命中的元素的兜底幅值。关键磁性元素应显式列在 magmom_map 里，非磁元素通常保持"
" 0。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0`. Fallback when an element is absent from "
"`magmom_map`. List important magnetic species explicitly and normally keep "
"nonmagnetic species at zero."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:60
#: f593ea804507488b9e63378abaa1bc8e
msgid "Lift Scalar（lift_scalar）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:61
#: f784b776037f45e3bc25e31e4cdd23a2
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。把标量磁矩提升为非共线向量。输入是标量但下游需要向量时打开；如果原始数据本身已有方向信息，不要重新提升覆盖它。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. Promote scalar moments to noncollinear vectors when "
"required downstream. Do not overwrite input that already contains "
"directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:63
#: 6a44fd84ed5a48709ef866260ccafda8
msgid "Axis（axis）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:64
#: 3de876674de64fc2a6ef86cdc998a1cc
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。cone "
"模式下的参考磁矩方向。这不是普通数值——改它会影响分层、表面法向或磁矩取向；使用前先确认 cell 取向和目标物理方向。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"Reference direction in cone mode. Confirm cell orientation and the intended "
"physical direction before changing it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:66
#: 9a209c1f3a2340b9b258e4b6a1e5b680
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式。"
msgstr ""
"Used by modes involving a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
"initialization."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:68
#: f6634b24e2c342f2bf6b717ead752423
msgid "Apply Elements（apply_elements）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:69
#: 9fce15b951414d4fbcf1669232698a39
msgid "`str`，默认空（全部生效）。逗号分隔限定只处理指定元素。含非磁基底时显式列出 Fe/Co/Ni/Mn 等磁性元素，避免给无关原子写磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default (all atoms). A comma-separated restriction to "
"selected elements. In a nonmagnetic host, list magnetic species such as Fe, "
"Co, Ni, or Mn explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:71
#: 13ecf2fc8ab04132acba787dc875d9fe
msgid "随机性"
msgstr "Randomness"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:73
#: 24de5b4aaff940219b4d80cf1ea30f37
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:74
#: 3263816ba42448eea31400827d1cf40f
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。需要可复现训练集、测试或对比实验时打开；最终大规模随机探索可以关，但结果不能逐帧复现。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enable for reproducible datasets, tests, or "
"comparisons. Exploratory sampling may disable it, but frames will not be "
"reproducible."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:76
#: 75322ee02d22477b8139d5519c934052
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:77
#: 6eacad0c976c4f14b00d5bcc6d69bef6
msgid "`int`，默认 0。固定随机种子值。相同输入、相同参数和相同 seed 生成同一批候选；只有 `use_seed=True` 时改它才会改变输出。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. Fixed seed. Identical input, parameters, and seed "
"produce identical candidates; it is used only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:79
#: 9f5a162c2a4e44728189aabe46a2a6b1
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:81
#: c343eb1178c543f0931e96d6e61644cd
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:83
#: 16fc2861fd7f415d96508e640e9a9e75
msgid "有序态附近的有限温扰动"
msgstr "Finite-temperature fluctuations near an ordered state"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:85
#: f5f3450314664299b1888d64266d2a65
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CorrelatedRandomSpinCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"mode\": \"Cone around reference\",\n"
"    \"correlation_kernel\": \"exponential\",\n"
"    \"correlation_length\": 3.0,\n"
"    \"samples\": 5,\n"
"    \"cone_angle\": 25.0,\n"
"    \"magnitude_source\": \"Existing initial magmoms\",\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"\",\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"lift_scalar\": true,\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"\",\n"
"    \"max_atoms_for_full\": 200,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:107
#: f2e80d079a5242cdba798e30c0cba576
msgid "PM-like 相关随机方向"
msgstr "Correlated PM-like random directions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:109
#: 0a9f4059b14e4a56b25086fae26867e0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CorrelatedRandomSpinCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"mode\": \"Full random directions\",\n"
"    \"correlation_kernel\": \"exponential\",\n"
"    \"correlation_length\": 5.0,\n"
"    \"samples\": 3,\n"
"    \"cone_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"magnitude_source\": \"Map/default magnitude\",\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2,Co:1.7\",\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"lift_scalar\": true,\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"Fe,Co\",\n"
"    \"max_atoms_for_full\": 200,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 7\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:131
#: 32cd994c03cc4255be4a06b8e7b2d904
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:133
#: e2c852afa42c4dedb824d190c8da29b1
msgid "`Set Magnetic Moments → Correlated Random Spin`：先统一磁矩模长来源，再生成相关非共线态。"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` -> `Correlated Random Spin`: establish magnitudes "
"before generating a correlated noncollinear state."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:134
#: 883bccc6a99c47828e22202f1f7e623b
msgid "`Magnetic Order → Correlated Random Spin`：从 FM/AFM 参考态生成有限温 cone disorder。"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` -> `Correlated Random Spin`: generate finite-temperature "
"cone disorder from an FM or AFM reference."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:135
#: de3f2b7234624a1b9c27b93e6270fc9e
msgid "`Spin Disorder → Correlated Random Spin`：先做离散翻转比例，再对局部方向加空间相关扰动。"
msgstr ""
"`Spin Disorder` -> `Correlated Random Spin`: set a discrete flip fraction, "
"then add spatially correlated directional fluctuations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:137
#: b1ac3c2fd1654924a0e6f6de0d297b0a
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:139
#: ae0835c91d234b4a87b37aca5e1c5225
msgid ""
"**为什么超过 `max_atoms_for_full` 直接失败？** 当前实现是精确协方差采样，需要 full matrix 和 "
"Cholesky，复杂度随原子数快速增长。自动切换近似算法会让同一张卡在不同体系大小下改变物理语义，所以 v1 明确失败。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the card fail above `max_atoms_for_full`?** Exact covariance "
"sampling needs a full matrix and Cholesky factorization. Silently changing "
"to an approximation would change semantics with system size, so v1 fails "
"explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:141
#: fdd486a87085437f9f37d9b5984d91a3
msgid ""
"**`exponential` 和 `squared_exponential` 怎么选？** 默认用 "
"`exponential`。如果你明确希望更平滑的随机场，再选 `squared_exponential`。"
msgstr ""
"**Which kernel should I use?** Start with `exponential`; choose "
"`squared_exponential` only when a smoother, shorter-tailed field is "
"intended."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:143
#: 76d3272653af4471bf477e85ad376877
msgid ""
"**没有磁矩会怎样？** 输入没有可用 `initial_magmoms`，且没有通过 `magmom_map/default_moment` "
"提供非零模长时，卡片会失败，不会生成零磁矩伪结果。"
msgstr ""
"**What if no moments are available?** The card fails when neither usable "
"`initial_magmoms` nor nonzero mapped/default magnitudes exist. It does not "
"emit a fake zero-moment result."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:145
#: c4cb2276056e4a85abe29b91efd81147
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:147
#: c07ebc66d80b420a9d1394b254608365
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`CorrSpin(xi={correlation_length},ker={kernel},mode={cone|full},n={eligible_atoms},s={seed},a={cone_angle})`。`s`"
" 只在 `use_seed=True` 时出现，`a` 只在 cone 模式出现。"
msgstr ""
"`CorrSpin(xi={correlation_length},ker={kernel},mode={cone|full},n={eligible_atoms},s={seed},a={cone_angle})`;"
" `s` appears only with `use_seed=True`, and `a` only in cone mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:149
#: 5f0bee7251494c408375e68802445964
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:151
#: cd85b80bcf18437cb036cad29e58e3fe
msgid ""
"开启 `use_seed` 后，相关随机场由 `seed`、输入结构稳定 ID 和 sample 序号共同决定。相同输入、相同参数、相同 seed "
"会生成相同磁矩方向。"
msgstr ""
"With `use_seed` enabled, the field is determined by the seed, stable input "
"ID, and sample index. Identical inputs and parameters reproduce directions."
